Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: Unknown task selector `winner`
  --> tests/ui/task_unknown_selector.jet:2:17
    |
  2 |     value: task.winner
    |                 ^^^^^^
 Why: Task selectors use `timeout`, `all`, `race`, or `any`
 Fix: Write `task.timeout(duration)`, `task.all { … }`, `task.race { … }`, or `task.any { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
